{{Stealnotes
| name = Requiem of Souls
| is_behavenormal = yes
}}

 * The ability has four main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Grants {{M|phase movement}} during the {{#var:Requiem of Souls cast point}}-second {{M|cast point}} duration.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Shadow Fiend Requiem of Souls Visualization icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Shadow Fiend Requiem of Souls Visualization icon-2.png|105px]] [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px]]
*** Creates 1 damage line per current {{A|Shadow Fiend|Necromastery}} stacks, the degree per line is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|θ {{=}} 360° / NecromasteryStack , MIN θ {{=}} {{#var:Requiem of Souls type1 value2}}}}
*** The first created {{Code|Line OP}} is always a straight line with a 180°-angle, the line starts from Nevermore's current position, point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] , expands outward to the game's East, regardless of Nevermore's {{M|facing angle}}, and toward point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
**** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Requiem of Souls value1}}+{{#var:Requiem of Souls value3}}}}-distance away with the travel distance and end radius.
*** The area of every single damage line is cone-shaped, spaced evenly with the other lines adapting according to {{Code|θ}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** All negative ability components can affect the same enemy units once per cast, once per expanding, {{ValueColor||once per contracting|agh}}.
*** The ability effects are applied as follows per affected enemy unit per line impact:
***# The ability {{M|dispels}} the following debuffs, if present or applicable:
***#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|nevermore_requiem_fear}}
***#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|nevermore_requiem_slow}}
***#* Hence, reapplying either debuff refreshes its duration and updates its ability values.
***#** {{cf|talnotes}} Learning the {{ValueColor||debuff duration increase|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l}} does not update the current applied instances, but updates the later applied instances.
***# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
***#* Hence, all lines may damage the affected enemy unit(s) when Nevermore is on the same coordinates as the affected enemy unit(s).
***# Applies two debuffs with the following ability effects:
***#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|nevermore_requiem_fear}}
***#** {{M|Cannot act}}.
***#** {{M|Caster-fear}}
***#** {{M|Disarm}}
***#** {{M|Silence}}
***#** {{M|Mute}}
***#* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|nevermore_requiem_slow}}
***#** The {{M|magic resistance}} reduction.
***#*** Stacks multiplicatively with other magic resistance sources.
***#** The {{M|movement speed}} slow.
***#* The debuff duration is defined as:
***#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Fear]]Duration {{=}} ({{#var:Requiem of Souls value7}} + {{ValueColor||{{#explode:{{Show|T|Shadow Fiend|v3l}}|/}}|tal|x}}) × f(EnemyHero) , MAX {{=}} ({{#var:Requiem of Souls value8}} + {{ValueColor||{{#explode:{{Show|T|Shadow Fiend|v3l}}|/|1}}|tal|x}})}}
***# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***#* {{cf|aghnotes}} [[File:Dota2 West.png|31px]] [[File:Dota2 Shadow Fiend Requiem of Souls Visualization icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Shadow Fiend Requiem of Souls Visualization icon-2.png|105px]]
***#** The lines now contracts from [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] , starting out from the max radius and becomes narrower, at the same speed toward Nevermore's current coordinates, and not to the original ability cast location.
***#** {{Symbol|bonus hprestore}}
***#*** [[Heals]] Nevermore for the full value per enemy hero affected by the {{M|spell damage}} component, regardless of the damage instance value. This is defined as:
***#**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{ValueColor||{{#var:Requiem of Souls type3 value1 agh}}|agh|x}} × f(EnemyHero)}}
***#**** This ability component considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
***#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
***#*** Once the line contracts, the travel path is fixed and does not follow Nevermore.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-4.png|4|21px]] {{Symbol|Death}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The passive cast upon [[death]] does not proc with {{M|reincarnation}} sources, and has the following ability activation sequence:
***# Applies the {{A|Shadow Fiend|Necromastery}} stacks lost on death factor.
***# {{Symbol|bonus instant}}
***#* Has an [[instant cast]] time.
***#* Works independently of Requiem of Soul's {{M|cooldown}}, and does not cost {{M|mana}}.
***#* Does not proc {{M|on-cast effects}}.
***#* Explicitly does not apply the following ability components:
***#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|nevermore_requiem_fear}}
***#** The {{ValueColor||contracting lines|agh}} {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}}.

